{"call_id":"961009f6b12d0d5f","request_hash":"f0237357123c5646292be06df9888a9f973bbda09033d712dd0115a32798c790","model_label":"gpt-6-luna","mode":"answer","cell":{"item":"PARA-001","condition":"p1-small"},"source":"cache","attempts":0,"result":{"request_hash":"f0237357123c5646292be06df9888a9f973bbda09033d712dd0115a32798c790","provider":"openai","model_requested":"gpt-6-luna","model_returned":"gpt-6-luna","text":"Before leaving, run a wash to clear any dirty dishes. When it finishes, unload the dishwasher and let the interior cool. Clean the filter according to the user manual and wipe the door seals with a soft, damp cloth.\n\nFor an extended absence, switch off the electricity and close the dishwasher’s water supply valve. Leave the door slightly open if it’s safe to do so. If the cottage could freeze, ask a qualified installer whether the dishwasher should be drained. When you return, restore the supplies and check for leaks before running a wash.","input_tokens":826,"output_tokens":113,"reasoning_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0,"time_to_first_answer_token_ms":1939.8660999722779,"time_to_first_thinking_ms":null,"total_latency_ms":2781.908500008285,"finish_reason":"stop","timestamp_utc":"2026-10-12T22:03:26.209414+00:00","error":null},"error":null,"recorded_utc":"2026-10-18T22:09:45.462197+00:00"}
