{"call_id":"ba89c767f758cc7f","request_hash":"ff35a7e5b5569df48b40293dde08dc858f6b3c074cae217889d94b3a65da4fc8","model_label":"gpt-6-luna","mode":"answer","cell":{"item":"SHARED-000","condition":"p1-small"},"source":"cache","attempts":0,"result":{"request_hash":"ff35a7e5b5569df48b40293dde08dc858f6b3c074cae217889d94b3a65da4fc8","provider":"openai","model_requested":"gpt-6-luna","model_returned":"gpt-6-luna","text":"Pause the programme and wait for the drum to stop. If the door unlocks, spread heavy items evenly around the drum and restart the programme—never force the door open. Check that the machine is on a hard, level floor, with all four feet touching and no rocking. If it was newly installed, check the installation guide to make sure the transport bolts were removed. If strong vibration continues, stop using the machine and contact Halvard Home support.","input_tokens":829,"output_tokens":95,"reasoning_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0,"time_to_first_answer_token_ms":699.1214000154287,"time_to_first_thinking_ms":null,"total_latency_ms":1363.363099982962,"finish_reason":"stop","timestamp_utc":"2026-10-12T21:42:12.255419+00:00","error":null},"error":null,"recorded_utc":"2026-10-18T22:09:45.466241+00:00"}
